	spec: 'EDIT paths expand a leading ~ to the home directory, as READ and GREP do. A version given for a file that does not exist fails as "<path>: no such file (<absolute path>)", never as a stale version. Restored invariant: a path READ accepts is the same file to EDIT, and EDIT reports the actual failure.',
	status: 'done',
